{"id":"c333bde956fbf86c","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-axiom.md","title":"GL Axiom","display":"df-gl-axiom — GL Axiom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-axiom","aliases":["89-df-gl-axiom"],"display":"df-gl-axiom — GL Axiom","depends_on":["[[89-df-lob-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-axiom — GL Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-gl-axiom-—-GL-Axiom-(Löb-Axiom)\">df-gl-axiom — GL Axiom (Löb Axiom)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{char}}_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{char}}_{G\\!L}\\)</span> 是下述定义的 GL 特征公理模式集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{char}\">\\(\\mathrm{char}\\)</span> 为该模式集的角色上标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}^{\\mathrm{char}}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{A}_{L}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}^{\\mathrm{char}}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{A}_{L}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}^{\\mathrm{char}}_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}^{\\mathrm{char}}_{G\\!L}\\)</span> : GL 的特征公理模式（Löb 公理模式）</li>\n<li>也写作：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box p \\to p) \\to \\Box p\">\\(\\Box(\\Box p \\to p) \\to \\Box p\\)</span></li>\n<li>GL公理对应于Löb定理的可证性解释</li>\n<li>该符号刻意区别于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" href=\"?note=1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" title=\"89-df-gl-proof-system\">89-df-gl-proof-system</a> 中包含命题重言式、K 模式与\nLöb 模式的完整公理集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathcal A_{G\\!L}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-gl-axiom-—-GL-Axiom-(Löb-Axiom)","text":"df-gl-axiom — GL Axiom (Löb Axiom)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-lob-axiom]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"该符号刻意区别于 [[89-df-gl-proof-system]] 中包含命题重言式、K 模式与\nLöb 模式的完整公理集 $\\mathcal A_{G\\!L}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A^{\\mathrm{char}}_{G\\!L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{char}","d